                "Validation Issue"
              ],
              "readable": false,
              "writable": false,
              "description": "A saved automation does not validate cleanly under the release's current language version, so it stays on the version it is written in. `Reason` lists what to repair. Emitted by the check that runs as a new release is deployed."
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "deprecated_version",
              "targetTypeId": "deprecated_version",
